1
00:00:25,860 --> 00:00:29,840
YAMU! YAMU! YAMU! YAMU! YAMU!

2
00:00:37,160 --> 00:00:39,100
It's time to do

3
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:04,100
Take it from me.

4
00:01:04,360 --> 00:01:08,077
Marek's winged dragon, Ara, is not a
monster you want to be messing with.

5
00:01:08,160 --> 00:01:10,297
Especially when it's in its Phoenix mode.

6
00:01:10,380 --> 00:01:13,556
But Yugi's got an Egyptian
god card on the field, too.

7
00:01:13,640 --> 00:01:16,520
Doesn't that mean Yugi
and Marek are even now?

8
00:01:16,880 --> 00:01:18,640
Not even close, Tristan.

9
00:01:19,240 --> 00:01:22,260
Marek's Egyptian god card
is in a class by itself.

10
00:01:22,760 --> 00:01:24,137
Yeah, and I ought to know.

11
00:01:24,220 --> 00:01:28,797
When Marek attacked me with that monster,
I was knocked out cold. Poor Yugi.

12
00:01:28,880 --> 00:01:30,720
Come on, Youg.

13
00:01:30,840 --> 00:01:31,920
You can do this.

14
00:01:33,000 --> 00:01:34,040
Now, Merrick,

15
00:01:34,240 --> 00:01:39,020
my Sky Dragon's special ability shall
rid the field of your Egyptian god card.

16
00:01:39,820 --> 00:01:41,140
Go, Slyper!

17
00:01:41,460 --> 00:01:43,900
Destroy Ra with your second mouth now!

18
00:01:53,160 --> 00:01:54,940
Nice try, Barrow.

19
00:01:55,620 --> 00:01:56,620
Oh, no.

20
00:01:56,860 --> 00:01:58,477
Slyper's ability didn't work.

21
00:01:58,560 --> 00:02:01,457
Did you honestly think you
could destroy a creature

22
00:02:01,540 --> 00:02:05,200
as powerful as my winged
dragon of Ra that easily?

23
00:02:06,020 --> 00:02:08,700
Sorry, but Ra is invincible.

24
00:02:10,260 --> 00:02:13,760
Now my divine creature will
unleash its fiery wrath.

25
00:02:14,320 --> 00:02:16,791
Ra's phoenix ability is about to activate,

26
00:02:16,960 --> 00:02:19,537
instantly incinerating
everything in its path.

27
00:02:19,620 --> 00:02:21,660
But Yugi has Slifer on the field.

28
00:02:21,960 --> 00:02:23,977
Does this mean that Yugi's Egyptian god

29
00:02:24,060 --> 00:02:26,707
card will disintegrate
at the hands of Marix?

30
00:02:27,640 --> 00:02:33,440
I shall surrender 1,000 of my life
points now, such a small price to pay,

31
00:02:33,720 --> 00:02:38,720
especially when it's my weaker
self that's paying the price,

32
00:02:39,060 --> 00:02:41,420
with his body, now Pharaoh,

33
00:02:41,860 --> 00:02:45,500
I can activate the winged
dragon's most devastating ability,

34
00:02:45,980 --> 00:02:50,800
behold, the rage of Ra as it
rins the field of your sliver.

35
00:03:01,620 --> 00:03:03,600
This is what happened to me!

36
00:03:04,580 --> 00:03:05,410
Yugi!

37
00:03:05,493 --> 00:03:06,323
Stay strong!

38
00:03:06,640 --> 00:03:11,180
Sorry, Barrow, but your
Egyptian God card is no more!

39
00:03:11,500 --> 00:03:12,360
No way!

40
00:03:12,660 --> 00:03:14,100
Yugi, don't give up!

41
00:03:15,320 --> 00:03:16,900
That's just the beginning!

42
00:03:17,460 --> 00:03:18,290
What?

43
00:03:18,620 --> 00:03:19,800
You heard me!

44
00:03:19,980 --> 00:03:24,297
I plan to prolong your anguish
for as long as I can until

45
00:03:24,380 --> 00:03:27,968
the Shadow Realm has claimed
everything that you now possess.

46
00:03:29,720 --> 00:03:32,260
Yugi, please tell me you're all right.

47
00:03:33,500 --> 00:03:35,240
Don't worry about me.

48
00:03:35,640 --> 00:03:36,860
I'll be fine.

49
00:03:37,220 --> 00:03:39,577
You need to concentrate
on defeating Merrick,

50
00:03:39,660 --> 00:03:42,920
because if he wins, the
entire world will suffer.

51
00:03:45,240 --> 00:03:50,760
My winged dragon has completed its task,
so I shall return it to my graveyard.

52
00:03:52,740 --> 00:03:56,800
Yeah, that's right, Maric used his
Monster Reborn to bring back Ra.

53
00:03:57,180 --> 00:03:59,857
That's why I was only on
the field for one turn.

54
00:03:59,940 --> 00:04:02,440
Right, that means Yugi's safe for now.

55
00:04:02,720 --> 00:04:06,191
But I'm sure that creep has
something else planned for him.

56
00:04:07,400 --> 00:04:10,400
That was a small taste of what lies ahead,

57
00:04:10,700 --> 00:04:13,760
but I assure you the worst is yet to come.

58
00:04:14,080 --> 00:04:19,760
I'll destroy your life points one by one
as the darkness slowly consumes your body.

59
00:04:21,900 --> 00:04:27,380
Sorry, Pharaoh, but I'm afraid you haven't
seen the last of my Egyptian god card.

60
00:04:27,600 --> 00:04:29,540
Ra will return to me.

61
00:04:30,180 --> 00:04:34,760
I activate my face-down card,
a trap called Zombie's Jewel.

62
00:04:35,560 --> 00:04:37,320
He can bring back Ra.

63
00:04:37,800 --> 00:04:40,377
This card allows me to
take a certain magic

64
00:04:40,460 --> 00:04:43,640
card from your graveyard
and place it in my hand.

65
00:04:43,780 --> 00:04:47,877
And I have a feeling you know exactly
what card I'm taking, don't you?

66
00:04:47,960 --> 00:04:51,880
It's the one card you possess
with the power to bring back Ra.

67
00:04:52,100 --> 00:04:52,980
No, not that.

68
00:04:53,300 --> 00:04:55,160
If you know, then tell me.

69
00:04:55,340 --> 00:04:57,540
I'm afraid you'll have to speak up.

70
00:04:57,840 --> 00:05:00,120
Well, I can't hear you.

71
00:05:01,820 --> 00:05:03,080
I'll tell you.

72
00:05:03,320 --> 00:05:07,620
I'm permitted to reclaim control
of your monster reborn magic card.

73
00:05:12,560 --> 00:05:15,517
Your precious magic card will allow my

74
00:05:15,600 --> 00:05:18,880
winged dragon of Ra to
continue its onslaught.

75
00:05:19,020 --> 00:05:24,360
But since I just played my zombie's
jewel trap, you may now draw one card.

76
00:05:24,580 --> 00:05:27,360
Perhaps this is the
card that can save you.

77
00:05:27,520 --> 00:05:30,500
The one Kaiba handed to
you when our duel began.

78
00:05:30,840 --> 00:05:34,777
Of course, in the end, there's
nothing that can truly save you.

79
00:05:34,860 --> 00:05:38,800
But perhaps you can delay your
demise for a bit. So draw.

80
00:05:39,220 --> 00:05:40,900
The shadows grow impatient.

81
00:05:41,400 --> 00:05:43,400
Frankly, so do I.

82
00:05:45,080 --> 00:05:46,240
Hey, Seto.

83
00:05:46,640 --> 00:05:49,758
Maybe Yugi can win if he
draws the card you gave him.

84
00:05:50,000 --> 00:05:53,280
I doubt it, but it should
be interesting to see.

85
00:05:53,600 --> 00:05:57,297
Yugi doesn't even have one monster
on the field to protect him.

86
00:05:57,380 --> 00:06:02,060
If Merrick brings back his Egyptian god
card, Yugi will be crushed. Hold on.

87
00:06:02,900 --> 00:06:05,837
When Ra comes back, it'll
have zero attack points.

88
00:06:05,920 --> 00:06:09,357
That means it can't do any damage
to Yugi's life points, right, guys?

89
00:06:09,440 --> 00:06:10,270
Wrong.

90
00:06:10,353 --> 00:06:13,917
Look, we don't know enough about
Marek's card to assume anything.

91
00:06:14,000 --> 00:06:15,941
What are you talking about, Joey?

92
00:06:16,100 --> 00:06:19,865
I think Ra's got a whole bag of
tricks we haven't even seen yet.

93
00:06:20,680 --> 00:06:24,880
Pick wisely, for you know what
becomes of those I defeat.

94
00:06:26,040 --> 00:06:31,377
Their souls are banished for eternity,
and their treasures become mine to keep.

95
00:06:31,460 --> 00:06:32,980
Just like this.

96
00:06:33,200 --> 00:06:35,024
Does it look familiar, Pharaoh?

97
00:06:35,220 --> 00:06:37,040
It's the Millennium Ring.

98
00:06:37,340 --> 00:06:38,920
That belongs to Bakura.

99
00:06:39,200 --> 00:06:41,357
He must have been sent
to the Shadow Realm.

100
00:06:41,440 --> 00:06:43,977
Yeah, we should have known
Maric was behind that.

101
00:06:44,060 --> 00:06:47,300
This item is my trophy for
eliminating your friend.

102
00:06:47,560 --> 00:06:52,380
And when I win this game, I'll be adding
your Millennium Puzzle to my collection.

103
00:06:53,140 --> 00:06:53,970
Never.

104
00:06:54,140 --> 00:06:57,257
Have you ever wondered what
your defeat will be like?

105
00:06:57,340 --> 00:07:00,760
You'll face the same downfall
as your friend Bakura.

106
00:07:11,720 --> 00:07:15,897
you'll enter the shadow
screaming just as he did and then

107
00:07:15,980 --> 00:07:17,417
you shall join the ranks of

108
00:07:17,500 --> 00:07:23,157
my other victims pharaoh no

109
00:07:23,240 --> 00:07:26,617
one has been able to stop
the destructive rampage of my

110
00:07:26,700 --> 00:07:31,080
winged dragon of raw And when
it releases its rage upon you,

111
00:07:31,400 --> 00:07:36,120
you'll be cast into the dark abyss
while I receive the ultimate prize,

112
00:07:36,480 --> 00:07:38,560
the boundless power of the Pharaoh.

113
00:07:39,360 --> 00:07:43,240
Now then, draw your card so
the suffering can continue.

114
00:07:43,700 --> 00:07:45,000
We can do this.

115
00:07:45,160 --> 00:07:47,748
We just have to draw
the card Kaiba gave us.

116
00:07:47,920 --> 00:07:48,977
According to Kaiba,

117
00:07:49,060 --> 00:07:53,200
it could be our only hope of
stopping Merrick's Egyptian God card.

118
00:07:53,600 --> 00:07:54,820
Take this.

119
00:07:59,000 --> 00:08:00,600
Kaiba put his faith in us!

120
00:08:00,800 --> 00:08:03,000
Now we need to put our faith in him!

121
00:08:03,180 --> 00:08:04,298
You're right, Yugi.

122
00:08:10,300 --> 00:08:14,760
The Pharaoh's faith in Kaiba has
invoked the energies of ancient Egypt.

123
00:08:15,200 --> 00:08:18,376
There is no doubt that he
has drawn the card he needs.

124
00:08:20,080 --> 00:08:22,460
I've placed a card face down, Merrick.

125
00:08:22,660 --> 00:08:23,820
My turn has ended.

126
00:08:24,760 --> 00:08:25,917
What's going on?

127
00:08:26,000 --> 00:08:28,140
Yugi didn't even look at that card.

128
00:08:28,380 --> 00:08:30,580
I've never seen Yugi do that before.

129
00:08:30,960 --> 00:08:33,017
He has no idea what he just played.

130
00:08:33,100 --> 00:08:34,620
What's he thinking, guys?

131
00:08:34,980 --> 00:08:37,760
Hey, Seto, what card do
you think he just drew?

132
00:08:38,540 --> 00:08:39,370
Seto?

133
00:08:39,580 --> 00:08:40,940
This is ridiculous.

134
00:08:41,480 --> 00:08:45,017
There's no way Yugi could know
what card he just put on the field.

135
00:08:45,100 --> 00:08:47,680
Deny your destiny no longer, Kaiba.

136
00:08:48,140 --> 00:08:49,680
It's fiend sanctuary.

137
00:08:50,480 --> 00:08:54,127
Fate has allowed the Pharaoh to
draw the card you gave to him.

138
00:09:01,440 --> 00:09:04,080
I've placed my chosen card face down.

139
00:09:04,360 --> 00:09:06,000
My turn is now over.

140
00:09:09,020 --> 00:09:11,737
It seems that the impending threat of the

141
00:09:11,820 --> 00:09:14,526
Shadow Realm has clouded
your thought process.

142
00:09:14,820 --> 00:09:16,420
You must have given up.

143
00:09:16,640 --> 00:09:21,464
Why else would you place a card on the
field without looking at it first, Pharaoh?

144
00:09:22,040 --> 00:09:23,937
Marek, you wouldn't understand.

145
00:09:24,020 --> 00:09:26,780
All right, back to the duel.

146
00:09:28,420 --> 00:09:32,157
It's time for my Egyptian
God card to return to the

147
00:09:32,240 --> 00:09:36,180
field in all of its fiery
glory to wipe them out forever.

148
00:09:37,360 --> 00:09:38,360
My move.

149
00:09:40,180 --> 00:09:42,580
I play Monster Reborn.

150
00:09:45,200 --> 00:09:48,960
Winged Dragon of Ra, return to the field.

151
00:09:52,720 --> 00:09:54,160
Rise, my beast!

152
00:09:54,400 --> 00:09:58,060
Stand beside me, and together we'll win!

153
00:10:00,160 --> 00:10:05,300
I shall now activate my Egyptian
God card's most devastating ability,

154
00:10:05,620 --> 00:10:09,740
making Ra completely indestructible
and sealing your fate, Pharaoh!

155
00:10:11,020 --> 00:10:12,860
Explain yourself, Merrick!

156
00:10:13,060 --> 00:10:14,557
What's happening to your body?

157
00:10:14,640 --> 00:10:20,480
I'm transforming my life points
into Ra's attack points. What?

158
00:10:22,540 --> 00:10:25,480
My monster's absorbing my strength.

159
00:10:27,280 --> 00:10:31,497
Of course, a small amount of
my power will remain with me,

160
00:10:31,580 --> 00:10:33,180
so I'm not gone completely.

161
00:10:36,520 --> 00:10:39,900
And you think it's wise to
weaken yourself like this?

162
00:10:40,060 --> 00:10:42,357
You're risking your fate on one move.

163
00:10:42,440 --> 00:10:45,920
Merrick almost completely
disappeared. That's nuts.

164
00:10:46,320 --> 00:10:48,202
Let's see if Yugi survives this.

165
00:10:48,980 --> 00:10:51,540
This is all that's left of me, Pharaoh.

166
00:10:51,940 --> 00:10:54,520
The rest has fused together with Rob.

167
00:10:58,400 --> 00:11:02,220
I have become one with
my Egyptian god card.

168
00:11:03,120 --> 00:11:07,620
This is the same tactic I used
to destroy your friend Bakura.

169
00:11:07,920 --> 00:11:11,057
I've created a beast that
can wipe you out with one

170
00:11:11,140 --> 00:11:15,160
blast by transferring all but
one of my life points to Ra.

171
00:11:15,480 --> 00:11:19,700
Now my Egyptian God card has
almost 3,000 attack points.

172
00:11:19,900 --> 00:11:21,960
Oh, but there's more.

173
00:11:22,340 --> 00:11:25,877
Next I'll sacrifice my
Jura-Gado and transfer

174
00:11:25,960 --> 00:11:28,960
its strength to my winged
dragon of Ra as well.

175
00:11:32,860 --> 00:11:34,840
Watch its power grow.

176
00:11:36,940 --> 00:11:41,560
Ra now has 4,699 attack points.

177
00:11:41,680 --> 00:11:43,960
More than enough to destroy you.

178
00:11:44,260 --> 00:11:47,140
Just one attack and this duel is over.

179
00:11:48,500 --> 00:11:50,860
That monster is way too powerful.

180
00:11:51,180 --> 00:11:55,657
If Merrick attacks Yugi's life points
directly, Merrick wins the shadow game.

181
00:11:55,740 --> 00:11:56,570
Oh, no.

182
00:11:56,680 --> 00:11:59,151
There's gotta be something left he can do.

183
00:11:59,260 --> 00:12:03,500
Now winged Dragon of Ra, attack
his life points directly.

184
00:12:04,180 --> 00:12:05,960
It's all over, Barrow.

185
00:12:06,120 --> 00:12:08,740
Sorry to disappoint you. What?

186
00:12:09,020 --> 00:12:10,940
I reveal my face down card.

187
00:12:14,340 --> 00:12:15,460
Fiend Sanctuary!

188
00:12:16,420 --> 00:12:18,680
That is the card I gave him!

189
00:12:18,880 --> 00:12:22,040
The one card that can
save him from Ra's attack!

190
00:12:22,920 --> 00:12:26,391
But Yugi placed it on the field
without even looking at it!

191
00:12:26,820 --> 00:12:30,173
So how could he have known
that he played the right card?

192
00:12:30,300 --> 00:12:32,400
This doesn't make any sense!

193
00:12:32,760 --> 00:12:34,780
It must be some sort of a trick!

194
00:12:35,280 --> 00:12:37,000
Now let's see if it works!

195
00:12:37,840 --> 00:12:40,577
Behold the magic of Fiend Sanctuary!

196
00:12:40,660 --> 00:12:42,180
Watch and learn!

197
00:12:44,440 --> 00:12:45,270
No!

198
00:12:45,480 --> 00:12:47,833
What do you think you're doing, Pharaoh?

199
00:12:48,340 --> 00:12:53,340
This magic card was given to me by
a friend to help me take you down!

200
00:12:56,140 --> 00:12:58,900
Now meet the instrument
of your destruction!

201
00:12:59,940 --> 00:13:01,140
What is that?

202
00:13:02,040 --> 00:13:04,600
It's called a metal fiend token!

203
00:13:04,840 --> 00:13:06,320
Thanks to my magic card,

204
00:13:06,500 --> 00:13:08,977
Marek's winged dragon of
Ra will attack that metal

205
00:13:09,060 --> 00:13:11,766
token instead of attacking
Yugi's life points.

206
00:13:12,020 --> 00:13:13,640
Keep your eye on the field.

207
00:13:14,260 --> 00:13:15,090
Ah!

208
00:13:15,240 --> 00:13:18,420
That token is casting a reflection of me!

209
00:13:18,900 --> 00:13:22,640
Yes, that's precisely what it's
doing, Merrick. You know why?

210
00:13:22,840 --> 00:13:27,020
Because I am no longer the target
of your Egyptian god card's attack.

211
00:13:27,240 --> 00:13:29,840
Now it shall attack you! Ah!

212
00:13:30,340 --> 00:13:34,977
And if I remember correctly, you've given
all but one of your life points to Ra,

213
00:13:35,060 --> 00:13:39,472
which means you'll be wiped out by the
hands of your own creature, Merrick.

214
00:13:40,820 --> 00:13:46,080
Ra won't destroy me, with only
one life point to protect you.

215
00:13:46,380 --> 00:13:49,968
I'm afraid you don't have much
of a choice in the matter now.

216
00:13:50,680 --> 00:13:52,000
You go, boy.

217
00:13:52,240 --> 00:13:53,937
We knew you'd have to smart that freak.

218
00:13:54,020 --> 00:13:54,850
Nice move.

219
00:13:54,933 --> 00:13:55,958
You the man, Yu-Gi.

220
00:13:56,240 --> 00:13:58,416
Now go ahead and finish this guy off.

221
00:14:00,520 --> 00:14:05,400
I must stop my winged dragon of Ra
from attacking or I'll lose the doom.

222
00:14:13,600 --> 00:14:18,540
Marek, as soon as your attack hits
my token, this duel's over! Ah!

223
00:14:33,200 --> 00:14:35,000
Nice try, Barrow!

224
00:14:35,520 --> 00:14:39,300
It looks to me like your
little magic card didn't work!

225
00:14:39,480 --> 00:14:43,280
You were a fool to believe
you'd win this duel that easily.

226
00:14:43,660 --> 00:14:45,189
You were never in control.

227
00:14:45,480 --> 00:14:48,380
I've been toying with you the whole time.

228
00:14:54,380 --> 00:14:55,720
How did you survive?

229
00:14:56,260 --> 00:14:57,400
That's impossible.

230
00:15:08,000 --> 00:15:09,340
I don't get it.

231
00:15:09,480 --> 00:15:12,737
Marek should have lost a duel
after that attack just now.

232
00:15:12,820 --> 00:15:14,760
How did you escape that blast?

233
00:15:15,080 --> 00:15:18,020
I played a magic card just like you,

234
00:15:18,160 --> 00:15:22,220
and it stopped Ra's attack before
it destroyed me. Impossible.

235
00:15:22,740 --> 00:15:24,160
What magic card?

236
00:15:25,420 --> 00:15:30,100
It was the D-Fusion magic card
I took from your deck, Pharaoh.

237
00:15:31,160 --> 00:15:35,980
It separated me from my winged
dragon of Ra just before its attack.

238
00:15:36,280 --> 00:15:38,927
That canceled out the
battle before it began.

239
00:15:39,480 --> 00:15:41,220
The saving my life points.

240
00:15:43,020 --> 00:15:47,460
So your strategy failed, and
now I'm stronger than ever.

241
00:15:47,900 --> 00:15:50,300
That was quick thinking on Maric's part.

242
00:15:50,600 --> 00:15:52,840
By using the Diffusion Magic card,

243
00:15:53,020 --> 00:15:56,760
he was able to end his own
attack before it backfired.

244
00:15:57,500 --> 00:15:59,760
Well, just as I suspected,

245
00:16:00,040 --> 00:16:04,460
Yugi wasn't able to successfully use
the card I gave him to defeat Maric.

246
00:16:04,680 --> 00:16:06,209
Don't give up, my pharaoh.

247
00:16:06,700 --> 00:16:10,524
I know that you will save mankind
just as the scriptures predict.

248
00:16:11,960 --> 00:16:16,480
