gain from the magic card I gave him.

249
00:16:16,900 --> 00:16:19,840
Let's see if he's smart
enough to figure it out.

250
00:16:20,620 --> 00:16:23,940
Now that I've regained
every one of my life points,

251
00:16:24,300 --> 00:16:29,120
my weaker half regains his body
from the Shadow Realm. For now.

252
00:16:30,540 --> 00:16:31,820
Odeon, help.

253
00:16:33,600 --> 00:16:36,060
Now, Ra, return to the graveyard

254
00:16:39,540 --> 00:16:43,660
And I'll place my Monster
Reborn in the graveyard as well

255
00:16:45,220 --> 00:16:48,080
Next, I'll put this face down on the field

256
00:16:49,560 --> 00:16:52,200
That's enough damage for now That creep,

257
00:16:52,340 --> 00:16:54,837
he's gonna bring back
his Monster Reborn card

258
00:16:54,920 --> 00:16:58,240
to summon Ra just like he
did before Come on, Yugi,

259
00:16:58,480 --> 00:17:03,560
stop this guy It's my move now Your
metal fiend may be protecting you,

260
00:17:03,740 --> 00:17:08,400
