you through this, Yugi.

266
00:17:24,960 --> 00:17:26,820
No problem. Just win.

267
00:17:27,500 --> 00:17:31,700
I give up 1,000 life points to
keep Metal Fiend on the field.

268
00:17:35,000 --> 00:17:36,740
Suit yourself, Pharaoh.

269
00:17:38,260 --> 00:17:40,840
After all, it's Yugi who suffers.

270
00:17:41,240 --> 00:17:44,640
Just so you can keep a
useless creature on the field,

271
00:17:44,880 --> 00:17:47,560
