272
00:17:48,080 --> 00:17:52,420
Perhaps Yugi does know the second
function of my magic card after all.

273
00:17:52,680 --> 00:17:55,000
I guess I'll just have to wait and see.

274
00:17:55,820 --> 00:17:56,980
Thank you, Kaiba.

275
00:17:58,000 --> 00:18:01,617
I knew your card would save me
the moment you handed it to me.

276
00:18:01,700 --> 00:18:05,053
Whether you believe it or not,
our spirits are connected.

277
00:18:05,860 --> 00:18:08,180
