field from one to three!

283
00:18:23,760 --> 00:18:26,760
No, he's going to sacrifice them.

284
00:18:27,840 --> 00:18:29,546
Well, looks like Yugi did it.

285
00:18:29,660 --> 00:18:32,778
He figured out how to make
the most of my magic card.

286
00:18:32,960 --> 00:18:36,880
Is the Pharaoh about to summon
his second Egyptian god card?

287
00:18:38,240 --> 00:18:41,020
I sacrificed my three metal fiend tokens.

288
00:18:43,920 --> 00:18:46,920
To play this, Obelisk the Tormentor.

289
00:18:51,960 --> 00:18:55,640
Behold, the Egyptian god
card I won from Kaiba

290
00:19:01,420 --> 00:19:04,020
Summoned with the help
of two of my friends

291
00:19:09,500 --> 00:19:11,720
Stare into the face of defeat,

292
00:19:12,000 --> 00:19:15,697
Merrick This is awesome
The obelisk will crush

293
00:19:15,780 --> 00:19:18,500
Merrick I knew Yu-Gi
would turn things around.

294
00:19:18,800 --> 00:19:20,637
Hey, get a load of Merrick, guys.

295
00:19:20,720 --> 00:19:22,757
